# Japan Weather Observations (JMA, daily and hourly)

Daily and hourly surface observations of every station of the Japan
Meteorological Agency (JMA): the official stations (気象台・測候所等) and the
AMeDAS network, converted to Parquet and updated every day.

- Source: JMA 「過去の気象データ・ダウンロード」 <https://www.data.jma.go.jp/risk/obsdl/>
- Stations: {{.Stations}} (including stations that no longer observe)
- Daily values: {{.DailyYears}} / hourly values: {{.HourlyYears}}
- Latest day: {{.LatestDate}} (JST). Values of recent days are preliminary and may be revised by JMA.
- Generated: {{.GeneratedAt}}
- Built with <https://github.com/hotchpotch/japan-weather-dataset>
- Local copies, freshness and updating them yourself: <https://github.com/hotchpotch/japan-weather-dataset/blob/main/docs/local-copy.md>
- Agent skill (Claude Code, Codex) with SQL recipes and pitfalls: <https://github.com/hotchpotch/japan-weather-dataset/tree/main/.agents/skills/japan-weather>

**This dataset is not published by JMA or the Government of Japan.** It is a
processed copy made by a third party. Check important values against the
original service.

